  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 1,000eb (Very Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Enhances:</strong> Skinweave or Fleshweave<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p>Enhances Skinweave or Fleshweave. The weave goes up to SP 9, and Martial Arts attacks stop halving it, though Melee Weapons and charged Tech Rebuilds still do. Rules it out alongside Subdermal Armor or Dragoon Plating. Under the Breaking Your Stuff DLC, treat the weave as a 1,500eb item for automatic maintenance.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Change the SP on the armor item for the skinweave by hand; an upgrade installed in cyberware can't do it.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; External Body Cyberware).</em></p>"
